{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"储能","country":"荷兰","country_iso":"NLD","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:04:52.321245","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"NLD-ES-0001","ldc":"No","location":"贝尔斯","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"荷兰贝尔斯Koelbedrijf Cornelissen工商业储能项目","project_name_en":"Netherlands Breda Koelbedrijf Cornelissen Commercial & Industrial Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科能源","content":"近日，全球极具创新力的储能解决方案供应商晶科储能宣布，其在欧洲的首个工商业储能项目已在荷兰完成安装。本次项目由 Watts In Store开发并完成设备调试，为荷兰著名制冷企业 Koelbedrijf Cornelissen 安装高性能电池储能系统，该项目标志着制冷行业在可持续能源部署方面迈出了重要一步。\n该项目位于荷兰的贝尔斯，集成了五套先进的工商业储能系统，即晶科海豚一体机，用于储存白天由光伏产生的电力，使Koelbedrijf Cornelissen 能够在晚上为其冷却系统稳定供电。该系统的安装提高了设施的能源独立性，同时优化了可再生资源的使用，减少了对电网的依赖，降低了能源成本。","content_sha256":"e6f9b7db1651568f145756d7d719ce29ad2bb23c7815122f695a0d504cc781cd","id":5693,"publish_date":"2024-11-29 11:05:32","title":"晶科储能荷兰首个工商业储能项目落地","title_sha256":"cfe38bde86aa899ac335c9a7eb8435c1e60f36c22de6f7b0bf884031b555385f","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/75464.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"NLD-ES-0001","capacity_details":"五套晶科海豚一体机","capacity_mw":0.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"0","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:04:52.321480","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"NLD-ES-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.jinkosolar.com/site/newsdetail/2187\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Watts In Store","project_developer_en":"Watts In Store","project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"晶科储能与Watts In Store合作，在荷兰贝尔斯为Ko